{"symbol":"NIBE-B.ST","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:17:42Z","info":{"address1":"Hannabadsvägen 5","address2":"PO Box 14","city":"Markaryd","zip":"285 21","country":"Sweden","phone":"46 4 33 27 30 00","website":"https://www.nibe.com","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","industryKey":"building-products-equipment","industryDisp":"Building Products & Equipment","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"NIBE Industrier AB (publ), together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, markets, and sells energy-efficient solutions for indoor climate comfort, and components and solutions for intelligent heating and control. It operates through NIBE Climate Solutions, NIBE Element, and NIBE Stoves business areas. The NIBE Climate Solutions business area offers indoor climate comfort products, such as heat pumps, water heaters, refrigeration systems, accumulator tanks, ventilation systems, climate control systems, and district heating products for homes, apartment blocks, and commercial properties. The NIBE Element business area provides various components and solutions for heating and control, which include tubular, aluminum, foil, thick film, PTC, high-power, and ceramic elements, as well as opena spirals and tapes, heating cables and jackets, vacuum brazing, heat pump technology, resistors, heat exchangers, temperature sensors, heating cables, flexible hoses, and control equipment to domestic and household appliances; professional kitchens and the refrigeration industry; energy; transport; and advanced technology, as well as aviation sectors. The NIBE Stoves business area offers free-standing, wood-burning, gas, and electric stoves; heat-retaining products; and chimney systems, as well as inserts, fireplace cassettes, outdoor stoves, and accessories. It operates in Nordic countries, rest of Europe, North America, and internationally. The company was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Markaryd, Sweden.","fullTimeEmployees":20500,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Gerteric  Lindquist","age":74,"title":"CEO, MD & Director","yearBorn":1951,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Hans  Backman","age":59,"title":"Chief Financial Officer","yearBorn":1966,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Terese  Leire","age":43,"title":"General Counsel","yearBorn":1982,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Niklas  Gunnarsson","age":60,"title":"Head of Business Area - NIBE Stoves","yearBorn":1965,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Christer  Fredriksson","age":70,"title":"Head of Business Area - NIBE Element","yearBorn":1955,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Kenneth  Magnusson","title":"Chief Sustainability Officer","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Simon  Karlin","age":57,"title":"Head of NIBE Climate Solutions","yearBorn":1968,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":6,"boardRisk":8,"compensationRisk":5,"shareHolderRightsRisk":9,"overallRisk":7,"governanceEpochDate":1793491200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":44.94,"open":44.8,"dayLow":44.28,"dayHigh":45.03,"regularMarketPreviousClose":44.94,"regularMarketOpen":44.8,"regularMarketDayLow":44.28,"regularMarketDayHigh":45.03,"dividendRate":0.35,"dividendYield":0.78,"exDividendDate":1779235200,"payoutRatio":0.2675,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":0.7,"beta":0.886,"trailingPE":34.1985,"forwardPE":26.5089,"volume":6443289,"regularMarketVolume":6443289,"averageVolume":6115370,"averageVolume10days":4723863,"averageDailyVolume10Day":4723863,"bid":44.88,"ask":44.9,"bidSize":0,"askSize":0,"marketCap":90319773696,"nonDilutedMarketCap":90602027970,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.21,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":46.99,"allTimeHigh":138.65,"allTimeLow":0.394865,"fulldayPrice":44.8,"fulldayChange":-0.139999,"fulldayChangePercent":-0.311525,"priceToSale